# Xcode
#
# gitignore contributors: remember to update Global/Xcode.gitignore, Objective-C.gitignore & Swift.gitignore

## User settings
xcuserdata/

## compatibility with Xcode 8 and earlier (ignoring these is recommended)
*.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
*.pbxuser

## Xcode 9 and later (supported since git 1.7.9)
# .xcworkspace is often managed by CocoaPods or Carthage, so we typically do not ignore it.
# However, for a simple project without deps, it's fine.
# But usually we keep .xcodeproj and .xcworkspace
# We ignore user data inside them.

## Build generated
build/
DerivedData/

## Python caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

## Misc
.DS_Store
.llb/
.gemini/
.agent/
.claude/worktrees/
